{
  "name": "FitPocket - WF1 Generacion de plan",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "nuevo-usuario",
        "responseMode": "lastNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "wh-001",
      "name": "Webhook Registro",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [240, 300],
      "webhookId": "fitpocket-nuevo-usuario"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "leftValue": "", "typeValidation": "strict" },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-userId",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.userId }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "notEmpty" }
            },
            {
              "id": "cond-objetivo",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.objetivo }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "notEmpty" }
            },
            {
              "id": "cond-diasDispo",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.diasDispo }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": { "type": "array", "operation": "notEmpty" }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        }
      },
      "id": "if-001",
      "name": "Validar campos",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [460, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://api.anthropic.com/v1/messages",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "anthropic-version", "value": "2023-06-01" },
            { "name": "content-type", "value": "application/json" }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "json",
        "body": {
          "model": "claude-sonnet-4-6",
          "max_tokens": 4096,
          "messages": [
            {
              "role": "user",
              "content": "=Generá un plan de fitness y nutrición personalizado en JSON para:\nNombre: {{ $('Webhook Registro').first().json.body.nombre }}\nEdad: {{ $('Webhook Registro').first().json.body.edad }} años\nPeso: {{ $('Webhook Registro').first().json.body.peso }}kg\nAltura: {{ $('Webhook Registro').first().json.body.altura }}cm\nObjetivo: {{ $('Webhook Registro').first().json.body.objetivo }}\nNivel de actividad: {{ $('Webhook Registro').first().json.body.nivelActividad }}\nDías disponibles: {{ $('Webhook Registro').first().json.body.diasDispo.join(', ') }}\n\nRespondé SOLO con JSON válido, sin texto adicional, sin markdown, sin backticks. Estructura exacta:\n{\n  \"meta\": { \"objetivo\": string, \"caloriasObjetivo\": number, \"proteinasDiarias\": number },\n  \"rutina\": [ { \"dia\": string, \"ejercicios\": [ { \"nombre\": string, \"series\": number, \"reps\": string, \"descanso\": string } ] } ],\n  \"dieta\": [ { \"dia\": string, \"comidas\": [ { \"momento\": string, \"descripcion\": string, \"calorias\": number } ] } ]\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "http-001",
      "name": "Claude API - Generar plan",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [680, 220]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const raw = $input.first().json.content[0].text;\n\n// Limpiar markdown si Claude lo incluye igual\nconst clean = raw\n  .replace(/```json\\n?/g, '')\n  .replace(/```/g, '')\n  .trim();\n\nlet plan;\ntry {\n  plan = JSON.parse(clean);\n} catch(e) {\n  throw new Error('Claude no devolvio JSON valido: ' + clean.substring(0, 200));\n}\n\nconst webhookData = $('Webhook Registro').first().json.body;\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    usuarioId: webhookData.userId,\n    version: 1,\n    activo: true,\n    creadoEn: new Date().toISOString(),\n    meta: plan.meta,\n    rutina: plan.rutina,\n    dieta: plan.dieta\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "id": "code-001",
      "name": "Parsear respuesta Claude",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [900, 220]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "insert",
        "collection": "planes",
        "fields": "=usuarioId,version,activo,creadoEn,meta,rutina,dieta"
      },
      "id": "mongo-001",
      "name": "MongoDB - Guardar plan",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.mongoDb",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1120, 220]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ { ok: true, mensaje: 'Plan generado correctamente', planId: $json._id } }}"
      },
      "id": "resp-001",
      "name": "Responder OK",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1340, 220]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseCode": 400,
        "responseBody": "={ \"ok\": false, \"error\": \"Faltan campos obligatorios: userId, objetivo o diasDispo\" }"
      },
      "id": "resp-002",
      "name": "Responder Error 400",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [680, 420]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Webhook Registro": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Validar campos", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Validar campos": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Claude API - Generar plan", "type": "main", "index": 0 }],
        [{ "node": "Responder Error 400", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    },
    "Claude API - Generar plan": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Parsear respuesta Claude", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Parsear respuesta Claude": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "MongoDB - Guardar plan", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "MongoDB - Guardar plan": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Responder OK", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    }
  },
  "active": true,
  "settings": { "executionOrder": "v1" },
  "tags": [{ "name": "fitpocket" }]
}
